{
  "spec": {
    "title": "High Resolution Time",
    "url": "https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/"
  },
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "name": "duration from",
      "href": "https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-duration-from",
      "html": "The <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dfn-duration-from\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dfn-duration-from\">duration from</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dfn-duration-from\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dfn-duration-from\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-duration-from\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-duration-from\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'duration from'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-duration-from\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dfn-duration-from</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-duration-from\">3. Tools for Specification Authors</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-duration-from%E2%91%A0\">4. Time Origin</a> <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-duration-from%E2%91%A1\">(2)</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=duration from=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/duration from=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog> <var>a</var> to <var>b</var>\n  is the result of the following algorithm:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "Assert: <var>a</var> was created by the same <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#clock\" id=\"ref-for-clock⑥\">clock</a> as <var>b</var>."
        },
        {
          "html": "Assert: Both <var>a</var> and <var>b</var> are <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-moment\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-moment⑨\">coarsened moments</a>."
        },
        {
          "html": "Return the amount of time from <var>a</var> to <var>b</var> as a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-duration\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-duration⑥\">duration</a>. If\n  <var>b</var> came before <var>a</var>, this will be a negative <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-duration\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-duration⑦\">duration</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "environment settings object/current monotonic time",
      "href": "https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-current-monotonic-time",
      "html": "For measuring time within a single UA execution when an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#environment-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-environment-settings-object②\">environment settings object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-settings-object-time-origin\" id=\"ref-for-concept-settings-object-time-origin②\">time origin</a> isn’t\n  an appropriate base for comparison, create <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-moment\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-moment①⓪\">moments</a> using an\n  <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#environment-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-environment-settings-object③\">environment settings object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-current-monotonic-time\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-current-monotonic-time①\">current monotonic time</a>. An <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#environment-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-environment-settings-object④\">environment settings object</a>\n  <var>settingsObject</var>’s <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-for=\"environment settings object\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dfn-current-monotonic-time\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dfn-current-monotonic-time\">current monotonic time</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dfn-current-monotonic-time\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dfn-current-monotonic-time\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-current-monotonic-time\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-current-monotonic-time\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'current monotonic time'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-current-monotonic-time\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dfn-current-monotonic-time</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-current-monotonic-time\">3. Tools for Specification Authors</a> <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-current-monotonic-time%E2%91%A0\">(2)</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-current-monotonic-time%E2%91%A1\">3.1. Examples</a> <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-current-monotonic-time%E2%91%A2\">(2)</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=current monotonic time=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=environment settings object/current monotonic time=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog>\n  is the result of the following steps:",
      "rationale": "let",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "Let <var>unsafeMonotonicTime</var> be\n  the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-monotonic-clock\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-monotonic-clock②\">monotonic clock</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#monotonic-clock-unsafe-current-time\" id=\"ref-for-monotonic-clock-unsafe-current-time\">unsafe current time</a>."
        },
        {
          "html": "Return the result of calling <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-coarsen-time\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time①\">coarsen time</a> with\n  <var>unsafeMonotonicTime</var> and <var>settingsObject</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-settings-object-cross-origin-isolated-capability\" id=\"ref-for-concept-settings-object-cross-origin-isolated-capability\">cross-origin isolated capability</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "environment settings object/current wall time",
      "href": "https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-eso-current-wall-time",
      "html": "An <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#environment-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-environment-settings-object⑥\">environment settings object</a> <var>settingsObject</var>’s <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-for=\"environment settings object\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-export=\"\" data-lt=\"current wall time\" id=\"dfn-eso-current-wall-time\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dfn-eso-current-wall-time\">current\n  wall time</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dfn-eso-current-wall-time\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dfn-eso-current-wall-time\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-eso-current-wall-time\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-eso-current-wall-time\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'current\n  wall time'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-eso-current-wall-time\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dfn-eso-current-wall-time</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-eso-current-wall-time\">3. Tools for Specification Authors</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-eso-current-wall-time%E2%91%A0\">3.1. Examples</a> <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-eso-current-wall-time%E2%91%A1\">(2)</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=current wall time=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=environment settings object/current wall time=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog> is the result of the following steps:",
      "rationale": "let",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "Let <var>unsafeWallTime</var> be the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-wall-clock\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-wall-clock③\">wall clock</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#wall-clock-unsafe-current-time\" id=\"ref-for-wall-clock-unsafe-current-time②\">unsafe current time</a>."
        },
        {
          "html": "Return the result of calling <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-coarsen-time\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time③\">coarsen time</a> with <var>unsafeWallTime</var>\n  and <var>settingsObject</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-settings-object-cross-origin-isolated-capability\" id=\"ref-for-concept-settings-object-cross-origin-isolated-capability②\">cross-origin isolated capability</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "initialize the estimated monotonic time of the Unix epoch",
      "html": "Each group of <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#environment-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-environment-settings-object⑦\">environment settings objects</a> that could possibly\n  communicate in any way has an <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-lt=\"estimated monotonic time of the Unix epoch\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\"><span class=\"bs-old-id\" id=\"dfn-estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\"></span>estimated monotonic time of the Unix\n  epoch</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'estimated monotonic time of the Unix\n  epoch'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\" class=\"dfn-link\">#estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\">2.1. Clocks</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch%E2%91%A0\">4. Time Origin</a> <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch%E2%91%A1\">(2)</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=estimated monotonic time of the Unix epoch=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/estimated monotonic time of the Unix epoch=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog>, a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-moment\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-moment②①\">moment</a> on the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-monotonic-clock\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-monotonic-clock⑤\">monotonic clock</a>, whose value is\n  initialized by the following steps:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "Let <var>wall time</var> be the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-wall-clock\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-wall-clock⑦\">wall clock</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#wall-clock-unsafe-current-time\" id=\"ref-for-wall-clock-unsafe-current-time③\">unsafe current time</a>."
        },
        {
          "html": "Let <var>monotonic time</var> be the\n  <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-monotonic-clock\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-monotonic-clock⑥\">monotonic clock</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#monotonic-clock-unsafe-current-time\" id=\"ref-for-monotonic-clock-unsafe-current-time①\">unsafe current time</a>."
        },
        {
          "html": "Let <var>epoch time</var> be\n  <code><var>monotonic time</var> - (<var>wall time</var> - <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-unix-epoch\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-unix-epoch②\">Unix epoch</a>)</code>"
        },
        {
          "html": "Initialize the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\" id=\"ref-for-estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch①\">estimated monotonic time of the Unix epoch</a> to\n  the result of calling <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-coarsen-time\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time④\">coarsen time</a> with <var>epoch time</var>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "get time origin timestamp",
      "href": "https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#get-time-origin-timestamp",
      "html": "To <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"get-time-origin-timestamp\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-get-time-origin-timestamp\"><span class=\"bs-old-id\" id=\"dfn-get-time-origin-timestamp\"></span>get time origin timestamp</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-get-time-origin-timestamp\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"get-time-origin-timestamp\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-get-time-origin-timestamp\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-get-time-origin-timestamp\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'get time origin timestamp'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#get-time-origin-timestamp\" class=\"dfn-link\">#get-time-origin-timestamp</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-get-time-origin-timestamp\">4. Time Origin</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-get-time-origin-timestamp%E2%91%A0\">7.2. timeOrigin attribute</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=get time origin timestamp=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/get time origin timestamp=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog>, given a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#global-object\" id=\"ref-for-global-object\">global object</a>\n  <var>global</var>, run the following steps, which return a\n  <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-duration\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-duration①③\">duration</a>:",
      "rationale": "let",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>\n      Let <var>timeOrigin</var> be <var>global</var>’s\n      <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#relevant-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-relevant-settings-object②\">relevant settings object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-settings-object-time-origin\" id=\"ref-for-concept-settings-object-time-origin④\">time origin</a>.\n    </p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "Return the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-duration-from\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-duration-from①\">duration from</a> the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch\" id=\"ref-for-estimated-monotonic-time-of-the-unix-epoch②\">estimated monotonic time of the Unix epoch</a> to <var>timeOrigin</var>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "coarsen time",
      "href": "https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-coarsen-time",
      "html": "The <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dfn-coarsen-time\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dfn-coarsen-time\">coarsen time</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dfn-coarsen-time\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dfn-coarsen-time\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-coarsen-time\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-coarsen-time\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'coarsen time'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-coarsen-time\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dfn-coarsen-time</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time\">2.2. Moments and Durations</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time%E2%91%A0\">3. Tools for Specification Authors</a> <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time%E2%91%A1\">(2)</a> <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time%E2%91%A2\">(3)</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time%E2%91%A3\">4. Time Origin</a> <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time%E2%91%A4\">(2)</a> <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time%E2%91%A5\">(3)</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time%E2%91%A6\">11.1. Clock resolution</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=coarsen time=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/coarsen time=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog> algorithm, given an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#unsafe-moment\" id=\"ref-for-unsafe-moment④\">unsafe moment</a> <var>timestamp</var> on some <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#clock\" id=\"ref-for-clock⑦\">clock</a> and an optional\n  boolean <var>crossOriginIsolatedCapability</var> (default false), runs\n  the following steps:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "Let <var>time resolution</var> be 100 microseconds, or a higher\n    <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#implementation-defined\" id=\"ref-for-implementation-defined\">implementation-defined</a> value."
        },
        {
          "html": "If <var>crossOriginIsolatedCapability</var> is true, set <var>time resolution</var>\n    to be 5 microseconds, or a higher <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#implementation-defined\" id=\"ref-for-implementation-defined①\">implementation-defined</a>\n    value."
        },
        {
          "html": "In an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#implementation-defined\" id=\"ref-for-implementation-defined②\">implementation-defined</a> manner, coarsen and\n    potentially jitter <var>timestamp</var> such that its resolution will not\n    exceed <var>time resolution</var>."
        },
        {
          "html": "Return <var>timestamp</var> as a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-moment\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-moment②④\">moment</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "relative high resolution time",
      "href": "https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-relative-high-resolution-time",
      "html": "The <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dfn-relative-high-resolution-time\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-time\">relative high resolution time</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-time\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dfn-relative-high-resolution-time\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-time\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-time\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'relative high resolution time'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-relative-high-resolution-time\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dfn-relative-high-resolution-time</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-time\">4. Time Origin</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=relative high resolution time=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/relative high resolution time=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog> given an\n  <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#unsafe-moment\" id=\"ref-for-unsafe-moment⑤\">unsafe moment</a> from the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-monotonic-clock\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-monotonic-clock⑧\">monotonic clock</a> <var>time</var>\n  and a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#global-object\" id=\"ref-for-global-object①\">global object</a> <var>global</var>, is the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-duration\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-duration①④\">duration</a> returned from the following steps:\n  \n    \n    The <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time\">relative high resolution coarse time</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'relative high resolution coarse time'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#ref-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time\">4. Time Origin</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=relative high resolution coarse time=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/relative high resolution coarse time=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog>\n  given a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-moment\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-moment②⑤\">moment</a> from the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-monotonic-clock\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-monotonic-clock⑨\">monotonic clock</a> <var>coarseTime</var>\n  and a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#global-object\" id=\"ref-for-global-object②\">global object</a> <var>global</var>, is the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-duration-from\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-duration-from②\">duration from</a> <var>global</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#relevant-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-relevant-settings-object④\">relevant settings object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-settings-object-time-origin\" id=\"ref-for-concept-settings-object-time-origin⑥\">time origin</a> to <var>coarseTime</var>.",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "Let <var>coarse time</var> be the result of\n    calling <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-coarsen-time\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-coarsen-time⑤\">coarsen time</a> with <var>time</var> and <var>global</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#relevant-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-relevant-settings-object③\">relevant settings object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-settings-object-cross-origin-isolated-capability\" id=\"ref-for-concept-settings-object-cross-origin-isolated-capability③\">cross-origin isolated capability</a>."
        },
        {
          "html": "Return the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution-coarse-time\">relative high resolution coarse time</a> for <var>coarse\n    time</var> and <var>global</var>."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
